  <name>IPTVX</name>
  <summary>Fast, memory-frugal IPTV player</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="pt_BR">Player de IPTV rápido e leve</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      IPTVX plays your own M3U/M3U8 playlists and Xtream Codes accounts with a
      modern interface in dark and light appearances, a command palette and a
      floating mini player. IPTVX is a player: it does not provide channels.
    </p>
  </description>
